# Documentation Reference Guide

## Quick Reference Commands

### Start New Feature (Most Common)
```bash
git checkout dev
git pull origin dev
git checkout -b feature/descriptive-name
```

### Promote to Staging
```bash
git checkout staging
git merge dev
git push origin staging
```

### Check Status
```bash
git status
git branch
```

## Key Principles
- Always start from `dev` branch
- Never work directly on staging/production/master
- Use Netlify UI for environment configuration (not netlify.toml)
- Follow promotion flow: dev → staging → production → master

## Environment URLs
- Dev: https://dev--translation-helps.netlify.app
- Staging: https://staging--translation-helps.netlify.app
- Production: https://translation-helps.netlify.app

